  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっと……あの、リチア……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um... Say, Lithia...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くぉらぁ〜っ、ウジウジすんな！
男ならスパッと言え！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>HEY! Quit beating around the bush and just say it like a man!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うん！
クリードにやられた傷を
治してくれたのリチアだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Okay! So, you were the one who saved me when Creed hurt me, right Lithia?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今更だけど……ありがとう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know this is late, but thank you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お礼なんて……
あの時はただ、無我夢中で……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, there's no need for that. I was just doing what I could at the time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>溺れてた&lt;Hisui&gt;も
助けてくれたんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But you saved &lt;Hisui&gt; from drowning too, didn't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい。人工呼吸で
息を吹き返してくれた時は
本当にほっとしましたわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. I was so relieved when my mouth-to-mouth respiration finally beared fruit and he began to breathe again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人工！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mouth?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>呼吸!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To MOUTH?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの時感じた
あたたかさって……
まさか……まさか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, so the warmness I felt then was... um...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ご、ごめんなさい……
ですが、あの場合
ああするしか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I'm sorry... It was all I could do at the time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;〜……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リチアが&lt;Hisui&gt;に人工呼吸!?
・お礼を言わなきゃね！
・人工呼吸は当然の事だよね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lithia gave you mouth-to-mouth?!
・You better thank her!
・See, mouth-to-mouth is important!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お礼を言わなきゃね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You better thank her!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカ野郎！
奪われた俺が
なんで礼なんか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>DUMBASS! I'm not thanking her for assaulting me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>奪うだなんて……
そんなやましい気持ちは
ありませんでしたわ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Assaulting you? I assure you, I had no such ill intent...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すまん……もちろん
助けてもらった事は感謝してる。
あ、ありがと……な</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry... I'm really thankful for you saving me. Um... th-thanks...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………いえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Of course.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、ねぇ、&lt;Hisui&gt;！
…………あったかかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, Hisui? Was it warm?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うるせぇーーーッ！
てめぇも人工呼吸が必要な目に
あわせっぞッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>SHUT THE HELL UP! I'm gonna make YOU need mouth-to-mouth respiration if you keep talking!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>23548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぎゃ、ぎゃぁ〜〜〜！
顔中が、あったかくなるぅッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>ARGH!!! His face being bright red proves my point at least?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>24248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>溺れた人がいたら
人工呼吸は当然の事だよねぇ〜？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See, if someone's washed up from sea, you need to give them mouth-to-mouth respiration!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>24612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なのに、初めて会った時
誰かさんはオレを
超〜〜〜疑ってくれたっけぇ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, hm, I think SOMEONE got super mad at me for doing it before, didn't he??</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>24736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わ、悪かったよ。
お前も
結構根にもつ奴だな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...S-Sorry 'bout that. You're the bold type too, y'know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
